 get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.99{M}_{0} & ={M}_{0}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/49.72} \\\\ 0.99\\cancel{{M}_{0}} & =\\cancel{{M}_{0}}{e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/49.72} \\\\ 0.99 & ={e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/49.72} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.99) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{-t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2/49.72}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.99) & =-\\frac{t\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{49.72} \\\\ t & =-\\frac{49.72\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡(0.99)}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\ t & ≈0.721\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the sample is approximately $0.721$ billion years old." 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326992 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326993 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326994 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326995 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1000 #edb/ref 17592186326996 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1041 "selection" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1104 #edb/ref 17592186326993 13194139535016 true] [17592186326991 1110 #uuid "301ad9f5-07d2-5f0a-b2c0-96e9f0f06fcd" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326992 1034 "$1.002$ billion years" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326992 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535016 true] [17592186326992 1111 #uuid "147bb96d-8a6c-57c7-b63e-6f4abe80b733" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326993 1034 "$0.721$  billion years" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326993 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535016 true] [17592186326993 1111 #uuid "aeef3025-2cdb-50fd-a658-fa284f84ca40" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326994 1034 "$1.438$  billion years" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326994 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535016 true] [17592186326994 1111 #uuid "eabd833e-06a5-59fe-862c-4a4c348e67d5" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326995 1034 "$2.045$ billion years" 13194139535016 true] [17592186326995 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535016 true] [1759218